1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,900
(Sheldon:)Cluck-cluck-cluck.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,570
(Amy:)Sheldon, look at me.

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:05,900
(Amy:)I think it's time

4
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,100
(Amy:)to face the fact

5
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,410
(Amy:)that Leonard is the nucleus
of your social group.

6
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:10,910
(Amy:)Where he goes, the group goes.

7
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,440
(Sheldon:)Leonard the nucleus?

8
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,240
(Sheldon:)That makes no sense.

9
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,580
(Sheldon:)I'm the whimsical elf

10
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,750
(Sheldon:)that everyone looks to
for a good time.

11
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,820
(Amy:)I'm not saying
that you're not fun.

12
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,820
(Amy:)You're the most fun person
I know.

13
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,720
(Penny:)A lot of people think
I'm fun to be around.

14
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,660
(Amy:)Don't be needy, bestie.

15
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:32,330
(Amy:)That's probably part
of what chased Leonard away.

16
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,860
(Amy:)What I am saying, Sheldon,

17
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:37,530
(Amy:)is that your group
is Leonard-centric.

18
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:40,140
(Amy:)If it were a town,
it would be Leonardville.

19
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:43,070
(Amy:)If it were an Islamic nation,
Leonardstan.

20
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:45,470
(Amy:)If it were the birthplace
of motion pictures,

21
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,680
(Amy:)we'd all be singing
"Hooray for Leonardwood."

22
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,310
(Penny:)Ooh, I got one.

23
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:50,850
(Penny:)If you guys were a band,

24
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:53,520
(Penny:)you'd be called Leonard
and the Leonards.

25
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:59,020
(Amy:)So needy.

